<title>USA: Alanex IPO postponed indefinitely.</title>
<headline>Alanex IPO postponed indefinitely.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Alanex Corp has been &quot;indefinitely postponed due to market conditions,&quot; lead underwriter PaineWebber Inc said Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The San Diego, Calif.-based drug discovery company filed to offer 2.5 million shares and was expected to price between $10 and $12 a share.</p>
<p>The IPO was expected to make its market debut this week on the Nasdaq National Market under the symbol &quot;ALNX.&quot;</p>
</text>
